    "comparison_rules": [
      "Errors may be ranked only within identical evaluation and output clocks, identical held-out row IDs, and declared fidelity/representation class.",
      "Every pairwise statement names its common successful row count and reports each method's full-envelope coverage separately.",
      "Source-stratified and QPack workflow-balanced summaries are companion tables; they do not replace the unified trained model's identity."
